1
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Illustrious Energy is a drama, history film directed by Leon Narbey.

2
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Chan and his older mate Kim prospect for gold in 1890s Otago.

3
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Marooned until they can pay off their debts and return to China; they’ve been
fruitlessly working their claim for 12 and 27 years respectively.

4
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Chan faces racism, isolation, extreme weather, threatening
surveyors, opium dens and a circus romance.

5
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Chan, played by Shaun Bao.

6
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:36,000
Kim, played by Yip Ha-Lei.

7
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:01,000
Wong, played by Peter Chin.

8
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:26,000
Surveyor, played by Desmond Kelly.

9
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:51,000
Illustrious Energy is a New Zealand film released in 1988.

10
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:16,000
It was filmed in Otago and was directed by Leon Narbey.

11
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:41,000
The tone is emotional.
